00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:23.000
but then white takes it, we take back.

00:30:23.000 --> 00:30:25.000
White drops back

00:30:25.000 --> 00:30:27.000
because white does get mated after king e5, rook d5.

00:30:27.000 --> 00:30:29.000
And then we can

00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:31.000
go king f6 and we've made some progress

00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.000
and we're ready to push the h-pawn.

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:35.000
And that's one option.

00:30:35.000 --> 00:30:37.000
We can also start with h5

00:30:37.000 --> 00:30:39.000
