you go back to e5.

01:16:07.000 --> 01:16:09.000
And you go back to e5.

01:16:09.000 --> 01:16:11.000
And this reminds me

01:16:11.000 --> 01:16:13.000
of something.

01:16:13.000 --> 01:16:15.000
And the bishop hangs. Now, maybe I would

